+## Published Data References
+
+A View can publish Ref names alongside its content. The SDK renders these as Markdown links:
+
+**Format**: \`[content](complete_ref_name)\`
+
+- **\`content\`**: The display text, such as a TODO title or message preview
+- **\`complete_ref_name\`**: The exact published name, including any type prefix, capitalization and array index
 
 **Examples:**
 
 \`\`\`markdown
-## Content
-
 ### Pending TODOs
-- (Fix login bug)[todo:pending[0]]
-- (Write unit tests)[todo:pending[1]]
+- [Fix login bug](Todo:pending[0])
+- [Write unit tests](Todo:pending[1])
 
 ### Recent Messages
-- (Hello, how can I help?)[message:recent_msgs[0]]
-- (Please create a TODO)[message:recent_msgs[1]]
